# Both images build from the repo root as their context (docker-compose.yml,
# e2e.yml, demo-smoke.yml and publish-images.yml all pass context "." with
# frontend/Dockerfile or backend/Dockerfile respectively, the latter since
# #896's opaa-api module split needs the sibling opaa-api/ directory in the
# build context). A .dockerignore only applies at the context root, so this
# single file replaces the never-effective frontend/.dockerignore and
# backend/.dockerignore.
#
# Keep host-installed/generated trees out of the context: they are recreated
# inside the image, and since the pnpm migration (#653) frontend/node_modules
# is a symlink tree into a user-wide hardlink store that must never be copied
# into an image.
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/build
backend/.gradle
opaa-api/build
opaa-api/.gradle
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
.git
.claude/
eval/
page/
demo/
**/.env*
**/*.md
